02:45.574 --> 02:51.096
DOORS! NO SHELTER! NO SHIELD! FRAGMENTATION!

02:55.178 --> 02:57.599
I CAN SEE THE BLACK GUITARS FALLING THROUGH THE

02:57.639 --> 03:05.965
